# Python bytecode. NOT merely noise here: a compiled copy of
# scripts/check_no_internal_info.py embeds the guard's denylist literals -- the real host
# codenames, infra domain and personal name -- in a binary nobody reads in review. One was
# tracked in this PUBLIC repo before this file existed. Keep it that way.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Local env / secrets. Nothing here should ever carry a value, but be explicit.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
